  m_text: 'MISSION BRIEFING

    To: J REDACTED, DL Storage

    From: B REDACTED,
    CEO, DL Storage

    Subject: Facility 72


    Facility 72 information

    Facility
    location: REDACTED

    Facility status: EMERGENCY POWER ONLY, LIFE SUPPORT OFFLINE

    Workforce
    count: 10        Workforce status: UNKNOWN

    Last contact: 2 MONTHS  (Data
    may be invalid)

    FACILITY IS GREENLIT FOR INVESTIGATION, XL-36 INVESTIGATION
    DRONE RECOMMENDED


    Objective: Investigate the facilty, locate and scan all
    workers to confirm current number and status (A/D)

    WARNING: last transmission
    suggested bio-chemical leakage and unidentified hostiles, procede with caution

    ALPHA-level
